.SS "bool SystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.VectorFlexSpan< T, TContainer >\&.SetAt (long index, T? value)"

.PP
Writes a value into the underlying container at the mapped position\&. The mapping depends on the current indexing mode: System: Start + index 
.br
 Reverse: End - (1 + index) 
.br
 Ring: Start + (index % ViewLength)

.PP
Replace() is used to perform the write operation\&. No length extension occurs\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIindex\fP Index inside the view (0-based)\&. Must be less than ViewLength\&. 
.br
\fIvalue\fP The value to write\&. Must not be null\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
True if the underlying container accepted the write operation\&. 
.RE
