.SS "SystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.VectorFlexSpan< T, TContainer >\&.VectorFlexSpan (ref TContainer vector, long start, long length, \fBFlexSpanMode\fP mode)"

.PP
Creates a FlexSpan view with explicit start and length\&. The view covers the range [start \&.\&. start + length), using the specified indexing mode\&. No memory is allocated; this is a pure logical slice\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIvector\fP \fBReference\fP to the underlying container\&. Passed by ref so the FlexSpan reflects the actual container rather than a copy\&. 
.br
\fIstart\fP Starting index of the view\&. Must be within the container bounds\&. 
.br
\fIlength\fP Number of elements in the view\&. Must not exceed the remaining container length starting at \fIstart\fP \&. 
.br
\fImode\fP Indexing mode used by the view: System = forward indexing, Reverse = backward indexing, Ring = circular wrap-around indexing\&. 
.RE
.PP

